From 28603bd7f4cb5e8d0546ec0c8a230caa1c32e4fc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: paschal533 <okwuosahpaschal@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 14:32:56 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(stablecoin): liquidate_position hook with
 proportionality bound and vault sweep

Engine-only (Variant C via assert_engine_call) hook that seizes collateral from an
unsafe position into the engine's custody holding. Checks position/vault bounds, the
U512 proportional seize bound (collateral x cover / debt x 1.25, rounded up, capped at
collateral), vault balance >= collateral (never ==), custody ownership/definition,
oracle freshness, and non-collateralisation via the new boolean
checks::is_position_collateralized (assert_position_is_collateralized delegates to it).
Full seizure sweeps the whole vault balance (donations included); partial seizure moves
exactly the seized amount. Allowed while frozen. Replaces the temporary guest stub and
regenerates the IDL.
